WEBVTT

00:17.380 --> 00:19.720
Depth, 150 meters.

00:19.720 --> 00:21.480
You're drifting to the left.

00:26.420 --> 00:29.260
Feel the movement of the ship with your body.

00:29.860 --> 00:32.290
The nautical's indication will be a bit slow.

00:32.830 --> 00:33.730
Okay!

00:33.730 --> 00:35.760
You're slow. Look to your left.

00:43.640 --> 00:50.940
Salvagers have become weak if even you can get a C-class license.

00:53.580 --> 00:56.250
If you're thinking about something else, then you're gonna do it again.

00:56.820 --> 00:58.050
I'm not thinking about anything!

00:58.550 --> 01:01.760
Distinguish the results of your operations.

01:01.760 --> 01:04.420
Feel it with your butt. Your butt!

01:05.130 --> 01:07.760
That's perverted. Darn it...

01:31.650 --> 01:39.460
Holding the rising sun to my heart

01:39.460 --> 01:45.060
I look far into the distant sky

01:46.470 --> 01:56.470
When I closed my eyes, a nostalgic wind blew between the memories

02:00.720 --> 02:10.720
Even if your painfully shiny smile is filled with tears, I'll live on

02:18.700 --> 02:26.070
We were born into a time where we can't go back

02:26.070 --> 02:33.520
No matter what awaits in the future that quickly passes by

02:33.520 --> 02:40.860
We'll walk on by trusting the endless love

02:40.860 --> 02:48.530
And tightly holding onto my own feelings alone

02:51.500 --> 02:56.670
Secret Game

03:33.610 --> 03:38.310
Ding dong, ding dong...

03:42.180 --> 03:44.450
Shoot! The clock stopped!

03:46.390 --> 03:47.380
Good morning!

03:47.720 --> 03:50.920
I missed homeroom again...

03:51.330 --> 03:52.890
Miss Sumeragi...

03:52.890 --> 03:56.130
Didn't we promise before that you would get punished

03:56.130 --> 03:57.970
if you were late again?

03:57.970 --> 04:00.230
Yes, Ms. Risako.

04:01.570 --> 04:04.340
Then wipe the windows of the school building after school.

04:04.910 --> 04:06.140
All of them, of course.

04:06.910 --> 04:09.010
All of them?! That's impossible!

04:09.010 --> 04:13.740
Miss Sumeragi, how many times do you think you have been late?

04:14.420 --> 04:19.480
Um, four times... oh, maybe it was five?

04:19.860 --> 04:21.620
If we just count the school days,

04:21.620 --> 04:24.060
then today will mark the 30th consecutive day.

04:24.060 --> 04:27.000
Wow, that's an awful lot.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.330
What are you talking about?

04:29.330 --> 04:32.430
Geez, you don't even live off campus,

04:32.430 --> 04:35.340
but in the dorms. They're right here!

04:36.400 --> 04:38.200
Well, I'm sorry about that.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.580
Don't act silly and try to cover it up.

04:41.580 --> 04:43.610
You lack seriousness.

04:43.610 --> 04:45.980
Wipe the windows and reflect on your behavior!

04:45.980 --> 04:47.380
Yes, ma'am.

04:50.890 --> 04:54.560
I can't help it! It's because I'm sleepy.

04:54.560 --> 04:56.620
But sleeping well is maturing well, right?

04:57.360 --> 04:59.920
Well, my boobs still have a ways to go...

05:03.170 --> 05:06.570
I'll find your treasure!

05:05.070 --> 05:07.440
I'll find your treasure.

05:06.840 --> 05:09.670
I'm a pro, so leave it to me!

05:06.840 --> 05:09.670
I will accept loans for the fee

05:06.840 --> 05:09.670
depending on your budget!

05:06.840 --> 05:09.670
First, just come to Aika Sumeragi

05:06.840 --> 05:09.670
at room 1A!

05:07.440 --> 05:09.870
I'm a pro, so leave it to me.

05:09.870 --> 05:13.710
I will accept loans for the fee depending on your budget.

05:13.710 --> 05:18.440
First, just come to
Aika Sumeragi at room 1A.

05:22.820 --> 05:25.340
I hope the first client comes soon.

05:26.690 --> 05:28.850
I guess it was true that you are C-class.

05:31.930 --> 05:32.860
Eri!

05:37.270 --> 05:38.860
This seems to be all of them.

05:39.700 --> 05:40.960
All of them?

05:46.140 --> 05:48.340
Hey, what are you doing?

05:48.340 --> 05:50.650
As class representative,
I cannot permit this.

05:50.650 --> 05:52.750
It's got nothing to do with being class rep.

05:52.750 --> 05:57.050
How much time do you think
I spent putting those up yesterday?!

05:57.050 --> 06:00.020
You can't do business at school, you know.

06:00.020 --> 06:04.190
If you do that, the reputation of class 1-A would be ruined.

06:04.190 --> 06:06.260
So, as class rep, I'll take them down.

06:06.260 --> 06:07.360
Give them back.

06:07.360 --> 06:08.430
I won't give them back.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.900
Give it back.

06:09.100 --> 06:10.230
No way.

06:09.900 --> 06:11.270
Give it back!

06:10.770 --> 06:12.330
No way!

06:13.030 --> 06:15.500
Fine then. I'll put them up again.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.840
If you do, I'll take them down again.

06:18.240 --> 06:20.340
I'll secure them so you can't take them down.

06:20.340 --> 06:26.250
I'll laminate them, and slap super glue on the back!

06:26.250 --> 06:29.740
You're so...

06:31.690 --> 06:33.520
Okay, that's enough.

06:33.520 --> 06:36.250
Teacher, listen! She...

06:37.890 --> 06:41.630
Class has started, so hurry up and get back to the classroom.

06:51.310 --> 06:52.600
Looks like you're having fun.

06:54.540 --> 06:56.910
What? Did you come to laugh?

06:58.080 --> 06:59.810
Come with me for a bit.

06:59.810 --> 07:00.800
Huh?

07:01.520 --> 07:03.040
You'll know if you come.

07:06.620 --> 07:09.320
Treasure hunting club?

07:24.240 --> 07:27.970
So there was a club like this!
I never knew.

07:28.440 --> 07:29.540
I made it.

07:31.010 --> 07:32.670
I'm the club leader.

07:34.020 --> 07:37.510
I didn't know your tastes ran this way, Eri.

07:41.290 --> 07:44.030
The civilization that was erased from history.

07:44.030 --> 07:45.990
The technology that disappeared.

07:45.990 --> 07:49.830
The art we haven't seen.
The treasure that lies sleeping.

07:49.830 --> 07:51.490
Don't you think it's romantic?!

07:51.800 --> 07:54.030
So, what did you want to tell me?

07:55.270 --> 07:56.400
Give it to me.

07:56.400 --> 07:58.270
Yes, Miss Eri.

07:59.440 --> 08:00.680
She calls you Miss?

08:00.680 --> 08:02.840
What? You didn't know?

08:02.840 --> 08:05.380
I'm a daughter of a rich family.

08:05.380 --> 08:07.480
A rich daughter?

08:07.480 --> 08:09.380
What's with that look?

08:09.380 --> 08:10.980
A rich daughter?

08:12.720 --> 08:15.050
Looks like I shouldn't count on you after all.

08:15.720 --> 08:16.890
Count on?

08:20.400 --> 08:21.400
Wow!

08:21.400 --> 08:25.170
Isn't this a Shinkai Industries mini-sub, the Beluga?!

08:25.170 --> 08:27.670
I love these things!

08:27.670 --> 08:31.210
If you're a C-class Salvager, you can pilot one, right?

08:31.210 --> 08:35.740
Of course! I could drive one of these with my eyes closed.

08:35.740 --> 08:39.480
Submarines from that era have a nice rear, you know?

08:39.950 --> 08:41.180
Want to ride in one?

08:42.180 --> 08:44.450
Do you want to operate it?

08:44.990 --> 08:47.190
You're gonna let me operate it?

08:47.190 --> 08:49.050
Okay, then it's a deal.

08:49.360 --> 08:50.390
Give me the handbook.

08:50.390 --> 08:52.260
Yes, Miss Eri.

08:53.800 --> 08:56.830
The First Treasure Hunting Club's

08:53.800 --> 08:56.830
Adventure Handbook

08:54.130 --> 08:57.330
Adventure Handbook?

08:57.330 --> 09:00.700
We're departing this weekend.
I'm counting on you.

09:00.700 --> 09:03.740
This weekend? No way, seriously?

09:03.740 --> 09:04.730
Seriously.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.680
I'm going to charge you a ton.

09:08.680 --> 09:11.370
You're going to charge for a club event?

09:12.510 --> 09:15.680
You want to ride the submarine, don't you?

09:15.680 --> 09:17.310
What are you going to investigate?

09:26.630 --> 09:28.690
Karen, excuse me.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.190
Go ahead.

09:35.870 --> 09:36.960
Well?

09:37.570 --> 09:38.770
What do you mean, "well"?

09:38.770 --> 09:40.510
It's just what it looks like.

09:40.510 --> 09:42.310
It's that kind of club?

09:42.310 --> 09:44.040
It's that kind of club?

09:45.050 --> 09:47.520
What are you talking about?!
It's not like that!

09:47.520 --> 09:48.980
Look right here!

09:48.980 --> 09:51.850
I don't really swing that way.

09:51.850 --> 09:53.150
We don't either!

09:53.150 --> 09:57.230
What? Don't be stupid.
Here, right here!

09:57.230 --> 09:58.120
Huh?

10:01.900 --> 10:02.890
It's a butterfly.

10:24.550 --> 10:26.420
Hey, numbers.

10:26.420 --> 10:30.060
Don't they look interesting?
I found them.

10:30.060 --> 10:34.030
I didn't know until Eri told me.

10:34.030 --> 10:36.360
I couldn't follow that.

10:36.360 --> 10:40.800
I didn't know until Eri told me.

10:40.800 --> 10:46.330
I see. So you didn't ask for this butterfly to be drawn.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.940
Maybe...

10:48.940 --> 10:50.810
"Maybe"?

10:50.810 --> 10:52.080
What do they mean?

10:52.080 --> 10:54.280
The numbers themselves don't have a meaning.

10:54.280 --> 10:59.850
But if you convert them into a matrix and transform them into lines...

10:59.850 --> 11:03.730
It turns into a meaningless alphabetical sequence.

11:03.730 --> 11:06.490
But when I took a better look at it...

11:10.700 --> 11:16.070
"The gate of the truth will be opened by the sleeping butterfly."

11:16.070 --> 11:17.900
And then this.

11:20.410 --> 11:22.040
Latitude and longitude, right?

11:22.040 --> 11:23.110
Splendid.

11:23.110 --> 11:26.480
So we're heading for that location?

11:26.480 --> 11:29.750
Yes. I'm sure the answer is there!

11:30.120 --> 11:32.590
It's a mystery within another mystery!

11:33.960 --> 11:37.960
I'm getting kind of excited!
Right, guys?

11:37.960 --> 11:39.330
Yes, leader!

11:39.330 --> 11:44.870
We're definitely going to find it, and win our first game!

11:44.870 --> 11:46.830
Yes, leader!

11:46.830 --> 11:48.330
What a weird club.

11:54.780 --> 11:57.440
But really, it's such a great ship.

11:57.880 --> 12:00.540
Looks like you really were a rich daughter, Eri.

12:01.050 --> 12:02.280
I guess.

12:02.280 --> 12:07.460
Then shouldn't you pay at least my fee, since you're this rich?

12:07.460 --> 12:11.290
No matter how much money it is, you can't waste it.

12:11.290 --> 12:13.800
Father taught me to hold to that.

12:13.800 --> 12:15.290
Waste?

12:28.710 --> 12:30.110
Here it is!

12:32.580 --> 12:35.220
You really like machinery, don't you?

12:35.220 --> 12:37.250
It pisses me off when you put it like that.

12:37.250 --> 12:38.620
Miss.

12:38.620 --> 12:40.890
Oh, my, Captain, what is it?

12:41.990 --> 12:43.390
Can you come here for a bit?

12:46.030 --> 12:47.620
Here you go, Miss.

12:48.660 --> 12:51.760
Well, thank you, young man.
What's your name?

12:52.630 --> 12:54.690
It's guh-guh-guh-Gusto...

12:55.470 --> 12:57.840
Goodness, what an unique name.

12:57.840 --> 13:00.540
Your name is guh-guh-guh-Gusto?

13:01.040 --> 13:02.810
Well, er...

13:03.680 --> 13:06.250
As you can see, this is quite a distraction.

13:06.250 --> 13:08.080
Can you do something about it?

13:08.080 --> 13:10.750
Darn it, Ms. Risako...

13:10.750 --> 13:13.150
More like, what's she doing here?

13:13.150 --> 13:14.790
Because she's the club advisor.

13:14.790 --> 13:18.690
Advisor? I see, so she's in charge.

13:38.680 --> 13:40.580
You guys can just die.

13:46.020 --> 13:47.180
An island...

13:47.760 --> 13:50.590
There was one on the charts before the Catastrophe.

13:50.930 --> 13:52.450
So it sank...

13:53.260 --> 13:56.530
So we're gonna find the sunken island?

13:56.530 --> 14:00.800
What kind of place was it?
Were there any facilities?

14:00.800 --> 14:02.170
There was a airport.

14:04.570 --> 14:06.110
Airport...

14:06.110 --> 14:07.940
Miss, I have said this many times, but...

14:07.940 --> 14:10.410
Yes, yes, I know.

14:10.410 --> 14:12.910
If anything happens, we'll leave right away.

14:12.910 --> 14:17.110
It's my duty to return you safely to your father.

14:17.650 --> 14:19.680
Um, what are you talking about?

14:22.220 --> 14:27.250
This is a dangerous area of the sea.
Anything could happen.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.930
Dangerous like what?

14:29.830 --> 14:31.400
All sorts of things.

14:31.400 --> 14:35.460
In popular terms, it's like the Bermuda Triangle.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.760
A devil's sea...

14:39.840 --> 14:42.410
It's scary...

14:42.410 --> 14:47.250
That's right! That's the kind of mystery I want!

14:49.420 --> 14:51.790
And so, when will we get there?

14:51.790 --> 14:53.220
The day after tomorrow.

14:59.360 --> 15:00.420
Excuse me.

15:01.600 --> 15:02.720
Me too.

15:06.500 --> 15:08.130
Isn't it going to be too dangerous?

15:08.700 --> 15:11.170
Danger comes along with adventures.

15:11.170 --> 15:14.770
Besides, that's why we have the captain and everybody here.

15:15.210 --> 15:17.200
I think we should head back.

15:17.710 --> 15:19.370
You worry too much.

15:22.020 --> 15:25.720
That captain's "It's scary!" actually scared you, didn't it?

15:25.720 --> 15:26.920
That's not it!

15:27.390 --> 15:28.960
That must be it.

15:28.960 --> 15:31.050
It's scary...

15:31.890 --> 15:33.090
What are you doing?

15:33.090 --> 15:35.590
I said, that's not it!

15:40.970 --> 15:42.940
You two get along well, don't you?

15:47.710 --> 15:49.180
It's taking them a while...

15:53.680 --> 15:55.180
Karen!

15:55.180 --> 15:56.880
Will you join us?

15:57.490 --> 15:58.850
If you'd like.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.920
Are you in there?

16:32.450 --> 16:33.440
Eri...

16:34.660 --> 16:37.460
Where did you meet Karen?

16:37.460 --> 16:38.430
At the pool.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.220
She was next to me.

16:52.940 --> 16:54.970
So then you started talking.

16:55.540 --> 16:57.810
I was curious.

16:57.810 --> 17:00.380
She lives alone in an expensive apartment,

17:00.380 --> 17:04.790
and she'll just go and buy stuff that even I can't afford.

17:05.290 --> 17:06.390
You stalked her?!

17:06.390 --> 17:10.690
Yeah. I had my dad research her through his network,

17:10.690 --> 17:14.720
and her birthplace and educational history are both unknown.

17:15.300 --> 17:16.630
That's impossible, right?

17:19.000 --> 17:19.730
What?

17:19.730 --> 17:21.740
You're the impossible one!

17:21.740 --> 17:22.600
Huh?

17:22.600 --> 17:24.670
Do you know what "privacy" means?

17:24.670 --> 17:27.970
I know what you want to say, but I wanted to find out.

17:28.380 --> 17:31.580
You're one hell of a class rep.

17:31.580 --> 17:33.780
It has nothing to do with being class rep.

17:33.780 --> 17:36.580
Karen is hiding something.

17:36.580 --> 17:39.390
I smell a big mystery.

17:39.390 --> 17:42.820
It's perfect for the treasure hunting club's first adventure tour!

17:44.190 --> 17:45.750
I'm so excited!

17:47.560 --> 17:51.430
Hey, don't put a damper on the fun here!

17:51.730 --> 17:54.670
Are you that innocent or that pure?

17:54.670 --> 17:57.640
Well, it's more like you're a little kid.

17:57.640 --> 17:59.610
I don't want to hear that from you.

18:07.650 --> 18:08.740
Yes?

18:10.120 --> 18:11.380
You want to talk to Eri?

18:18.630 --> 18:19.620
Eri!

18:34.080 --> 18:35.340
Let's go.

18:40.110 --> 18:41.520
Anesthetic bullets?

18:41.520 --> 18:43.480
Is this a surprise party?

18:43.480 --> 18:45.090
Are you kidding me?

18:45.090 --> 18:48.580
What are you guys doing to your leader?

18:59.900 --> 19:01.030
Aika!

19:33.930 --> 19:34.960
Look.

19:39.140 --> 19:40.440
What is it?

19:40.440 --> 19:45.140
There's some kind of machine on the butt and the neck.

19:45.950 --> 19:46.940
How gross.

19:47.450 --> 19:50.280
Was someone controlling them with those things?

19:51.850 --> 19:52.840
We've got trouble!

19:54.820 --> 19:56.760
Hey, are you okay?

19:56.760 --> 19:57.880
You okay?

20:01.230 --> 20:02.160
Everyone...

20:03.500 --> 20:04.530
What's that?

20:04.530 --> 20:05.430
A chopper?

20:18.250 --> 20:19.580
Let the girl go!

20:38.400 --> 20:40.030
You're not getting away.

20:54.320 --> 20:56.320
Teacher, why?

20:56.320 --> 21:00.450
Too bad. I guess those girls failed.

21:05.460 --> 21:08.520
Miss Sumeragi, I'll tell you this.

21:09.130 --> 21:11.690
You should not trust others.

21:14.740 --> 21:17.170
I hate those kinds of things!

21:21.840 --> 21:22.940
Really?

21:47.100 --> 21:49.540
How am I supposed to carry them to sick bay?

21:54.880 --> 21:56.400
We know what happened.

21:57.140 --> 21:58.910
For now, let's get them to sick bay.

22:02.380 --> 22:04.650
Miss, we are heading back.

22:04.650 --> 22:05.640
What?

22:06.150 --> 22:07.280
Got it?

22:09.690 --> 22:10.690
I'm going on.

22:10.690 --> 22:11.760
Miss!

22:11.390 --> 22:13.530
Of course I'm going on!

22:13.530 --> 22:16.230
Our classmates were mind-controlled to attack us.

22:16.230 --> 22:20.170
The person doing the controlling was, surprisingly, our club advisor!

22:20.170 --> 22:22.340
What's her true identity?!
What's her motive?!

22:22.340 --> 22:24.970
A mystery within another mystery.

22:24.970 --> 22:29.180
This is what you call honest-to-goodness adventure!

22:29.180 --> 22:31.610
Captain, if you turn back here,

22:31.610 --> 22:34.250
I'll have Father fire you.

22:34.250 --> 22:35.310
Got it?

22:36.050 --> 22:37.140
Eri!

22:37.890 --> 22:39.320
This is a nightmare.

22:39.720 --> 22:41.660
Can you tell her to stop?

22:43.320 --> 22:45.390
This isn't just a game!

22:45.390 --> 22:47.930
Eri's the one that hired me,

22:47.930 --> 22:51.830
so if she says she'll go, then there's nothing I can do, right?

22:51.830 --> 22:53.900
Nothing you can do?

22:53.900 --> 22:55.540
Such troublesome kids.

22:55.540 --> 22:57.530
Nothing I can do about it.

23:05.710 --> 23:07.110
A mystery?

23:20.330 --> 23:28.360
I swear to that dream that
I will protect you, rise

23:32.070 --> 23:42.070
No one waits at the farthest end of someone else's dream

23:43.920 --> 23:53.920
I wished for feelings to be carried and flown up high into the sky

23:55.630 --> 24:01.370
I was endlessly struggling and miserably in pain

24:01.370 --> 24:08.880
So I tightly gripped my weakness in my hands

24:08.880 --> 24:18.880
I swear I'll send you the hopes that melt the sadness, rise

24:20.620 --> 24:30.360
I'll head to tomorrow by holding onto niceness and strength

24:30.360 --> 24:36.270
And I'll swear, rise

24:38.340 --> 24:44.440
I'll swear to tomorrow, rise

24:54.220 --> 24:55.460
Next episode is...

24:55.460 --> 24:57.050
Eri, you have on the wrong socks.

24:58.290 --> 24:59.590
You messed up! How embarrassing!

24:59.590 --> 25:01.530
No, this is the fashion.

25:01.200 --> 25:02.130
You said, "Ah!"

25:02.130 --> 25:03.060
It's fashion.

25:03.060 --> 25:04.260
Liar!

25:03.630 --> 25:04.570
I'm not lying!

25:04.260 --> 25:05.370
It's a lie!

25:04.970 --> 25:06.800
Socks become essential in the next episode.

25:06.800 --> 25:08.060
It can't be.

25:08.470 --> 25:13.340
peach peach Beach

25:08.470 --> 25:13.340
Look forward to the next episode!
